title: "Tennis Analytics: Data, Analysis and Visualization"
abstract: "An open-source platform hosting interactive data stories and visualizations of ATP Open Era tennis statistics (1968-2026), powered by sorukumar/tml-data. Includes custom metrics such as GSDI (Grand Slam Dominance Index) and NBI (Nail-Biter Index)."
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
url: "https://sorukumar.github.io/tennis-analytics/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sorukumar/tennis-analytics"
license: MIT
keywords:
